 "title": "Bidirectional 24 V ESD protection diode, 30 pF max, SOD-323",
 "source": {
  "revision": "Rev:2.2",
  "pages": 3
 },
 "summary": "A single-line bidirectional transient suppressor in a two-terminal SOD-323 package. It stands off up to 24 V in either polarity, breaks down between 26.5 V and 31 V, and limits a 6 A 8/20 µs surge to 50 V at most. It withstands ±30 kV air and contact discharges to IEC 61000-4-2, with junction capacitance no more than 30 pF. Named uses are LED lighting modules, RS232/RS485, CAN and LIN buses, portable instruments and general-purpose I/O.",
 "key_figures": [
